5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I need to understand how a new holding impacts our quarter-end reporting and audit timelines.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the time we spend sourcing talent for our portfolio companies.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I would like to review the actual retention data of our past investments to see what stuck.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I am worried about our cash flow and what we can borrow against for future needs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,I want to know what external obstacles typically delay our deals from signing to deployment.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, do you think the recruiter data will show if we are over-relying on them?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, I suspect the placement times for specialized roles are the real bottleneck.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, perhaps looking at the credit line terms will clarify our borrowing capacity.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, that is a good point. I will look into the credit line and the reserve accounts.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I plan to check the security review times and the delivery records of our holdings.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will investigate the appraisal needs at the last audit and the independent checks on figures.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
