35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,The audit data shows hardware-heavy assets add six weeks to our close. That is a significant drag.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, that aligns with my findings. We have no bench for logistics or field operations.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"My review shows our software tools for clinics and fields retained customers well, unlike the retail tool.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, that is helpful. My findings show our credit line ignores subscription revenue, which is a major gap.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, the security review data confirms my suspicion. Medical and financial data adds three quarters of delay.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Shion, so if we pick a company handling sensitive data, we are signing up for a long wait.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, and if it needs field crews, we have no one to help them hire.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, the write-off was a company with hourly crews. We should avoid that operational model.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, exactly. And since our credit line doesn't value subscriptions, we need assets we can borrow against.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, the delivery records show hardware assembly is risky. The bank tool was reliable because it was pure software.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"So, we want software, but not the kind that requires heavy security reviews or field hardware.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, that points away from the sensor company and the clinic scheduler if it involves medical records.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Jonathan, the clinic scheduler kept its customers. But the sensor company also did.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shizue, but the sensor company has hardware. That means appraisal fees and no borrowing power.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, correct. The bank reconciliation tool is pure software, no hardware, and likely no heavy security review.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I am leaning towards the bank reconciliation tool. It fits our reporting and borrowing constraints.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mizuki, I agree. It avoids the hiring bottleneck and the audit delays.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"@Mizuki, I am comfortable with that. It is a quiet back-office tool, like our successful exits.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Mizuki, yes. It allows us to use the credit line effectively if we structure it right.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, I concur. It is the only one that avoids the external obstacles I identified.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
